{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","帕瑞莎"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名优雅的法师，能为自身和友军提升攻击速度，擅长应对站位密集的敌人。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","繁花亦有利刺"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","The most beautiful flowers can have the sharpest thorns."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","新的花蕾绽放了"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","A new bloom is emerging."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","听，花的声音——"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Listen to the voice of the flowers."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","终于，凋零了啊……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Withered... finally."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","胜利，是最为美丽的绽放"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Victory blooms most beautifully!"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","让花朵开遍这片土地吧"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","愿流盈树护友。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","生命的新芽真让人感动。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","又到了繁花盛放的季节，来，一起观赏吧？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我……很少见到这么美丽的礼物！不、不能失态……谢谢你。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","无功不受禄，但……一片心意，我会收下的。"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","森流花歌"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","在林中漫步的身影，比任何花朵都更美丽。"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","溪藤繁花"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","溪水穿越丛林，枯萎的枝蔓也会发出新芽。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","参与活动“对决战略”可得该皮肤。"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","史诗"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我带了些新的花朵来"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","工作之余也需要休闲"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","想试试新的花草茶吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","再放些鲜花会更美"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","雪中的灯火，真温馨啊"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","很有节日氛围啊"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","焰火和鲜花一样美丽"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","帕瑞莎喜爱喝各种花茶，其中不乏功效强劲的种类。这是她平淡生活中唯一有些出格的小爱好。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","在偶尔休假的日子，帕瑞莎常睡过整个白天，然后在夜晚自责地醒来。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","整个荆棘卫队中，帕瑞莎休假是最少的。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","据年长的教师们回忆，学生时代的帕瑞莎总是在比赛中获得第二名的好成绩。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","“队长虽然很好，但总觉得她对自己和部下都有点太苛刻了……”一名已经离开荆棘卫队的队员说。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","据荆棘卫队的成员说，帕瑞莎当上队长后，亲手铲掉了许多过去种下的花田，因为这些爱好会令她在工作中分心。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","据莱卡说，学生时代的帕瑞莎，有时会避开大家，和自己种下的花儿说话。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","帕瑞莎擅长窨制花茶，莱卡常向她借取茶叶，不仅用来喝，也用来占卜。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","帕瑞莎最介意莱卡的地方之一，就是莱卡非常相信预示和命运。在她看来，没有什么比紧紧握在手中的努力和勤勉更为重要。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","据说，帕瑞莎是在伊米尔真正属意的候选人拒绝后，才得到了成为队长的机会。但帕瑞莎仍然对此充满感激。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","嗯……这么多花草，哪些泡茶会好一点呢……"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415011.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","莱卡 & 帕瑞莎"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","之前第四小队提交过报告，希望能增配人手……"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415024.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","帕瑞莎 & 卡夫拉"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","我已经很久没有见到过妖精了……上一次，是什么时候来着？"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415045.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","帕瑞莎 & 塔西"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","我带了些新的花朵来"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415120.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","帕瑞莎"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","想试试新的花草茶吗？"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415121.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","帕瑞莎"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","再放些鲜花会更美"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415429.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","帕瑞莎"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","雪中的灯火，真温馨啊"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415430.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","帕瑞莎"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","很有节日氛围啊"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415603.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","帕瑞莎"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","焰火和鲜花一样美丽"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415604.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","帕瑞莎"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","没想到，我们好不容易再见面，却是在这样的情况下……"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412030.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","帕瑞莎 & 莱卡 & 卡夫拉"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","说起来，我们三个真是难得聚在一起。"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412110.json"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/cn","莱卡 & 埃隆 & 帕瑞莎"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/cn","无论看到多少次，卡夫拉这把大剑的威慑力还是很强……"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412170.json"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/cn","莱卡 & 卡夫拉 & 帕瑞莎"]]}